# [Seq.Cons p] pattern: bind payload dict, access head via p.head and tail via p.tail.
# T-1154: [Seq h t] no longer binds h/t; use [Seq.Cons p] form for both outer and inner.
# Regression: tail binding must remain unevaluated (lazy) until accessed as p.tail.
[match [range 10 13]
  [case [let p] [Seq.Cons p]
    [match p.tail
      [case [let p2] [Seq.Cons p2] [+ p.head p2.head]]
      _: 0]]
  _: 0]
=== out
Int(21)
